  "notes": "The official 2026 primary ballot notice specifies two Republican county committee members per election precinct. The May 5 filed-candidate notice lists two candidates in Elk Lick Township, one in Lower Turkeyfoot Township, and one in Somerset Township No. 3; no other Republican county committee candidates filed. It also reports that a Democratic candidate was inadvertently printed on the Republican ballot in Somerset Borough Southwest. These six positions are unknown because the candidate list does not certify winners or resolve the printing error. The remaining 128 positions are empty_no_filer, which means no Republican filed a nomination petition, not a verified current vacancy: write-ins or later appointments may have filled them. No candidate names are stored."
